Attribution for Common Paper legal templates
============================================

The Markdown files in the `templates/` directory are sourced from the
Common Paper GitHub organization (https://github.com/CommonPaper) and the
Common Paper standards site (https://commonpaper.com/standards/).

Those agreements are released by Common Paper for free use and modification
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International Licence (CC BY 4.0):

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Full legal text of the licence:

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

You are free to share and adapt the material for any purpose, even
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit, provide a link to the
licence, and indicate if changes were made.

Attribution notice
------------------

This project includes Common Paper standard agreement templates.
Common Paper agreements © their respective authors / Common Paper,
licensed under CC BY 4.0.

See `catalog.json` for the mapping from each local template file to its
upstream repository.
